---
// Layers section — 4-layer diagram showing where RTK sits in the AI token stack
---
<section class="layers-section" id="layers" aria-labelledby="layers-title">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="section-num">02</div>
    <h2 id="layers-title">Other tools intercept the API.<br><span class="layers-accent">RTK intercepts the terminal.</span></h2>
    <p class="section-sub">
      There are four layers where you can reduce token usage. Only one works with every billing model — including Claude Code Max &amp; Pro.
    </p>

    <div class="layers-diagram" role="list" aria-label="Token optimization layers">

      <div class="layer layer-rtk" role="listitem" aria-current="true">
        <div class="layer-badge">L1</div>
        <div class="layer-content">
          <div class="layer-name">
            <span class="layer-tool">RTK — CLI proxy</span>
            <span class="layer-tag">you are here</span>
          </div>
          <p class="layer-desc">Intercepts terminal output before it enters any AI context window. Works at the process level — no API key, no account, no billing dependency.</p>
          <div class="layer-examples">
            <code>rtk git status</code>
            <code>rtk cargo test</code>
            <code>rtk grep</code>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="layer-stat">−89%<span>avg tokens</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="layer layer-other" role="listitem">
        <div class="layer-badge">L2</div>
        <div class="layer-content">
          <div class="layer-name">
            <span class="layer-tool">MCP servers</span>
          </div>
          <p class="layer-desc">Inject curated context inside the agent loop. Compress inside, not before. Complementary — stack with RTK.</p>
          <div class="layer-examples muted">
            <code>context-mode</code>
            <code>Serena</code>
            <code>token-savior</code>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="layer layer-other" role="listitem">
        <div class="layer-badge">L3</div>
        <div class="layer-content">
          <div class="layer-name">
            <span class="layer-tool">Output style flags</span>
          </div>
          <p class="layer-desc">Shorten AI responses via prompting. Trims outputs, not inputs. Also complementary.</p>
          <div class="layer-examples muted">
            <code>Caveman</code>
            <code>--uc flags</code>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="layer layer-blind" role="listitem">
        <div class="layer-badge">L4</div>
        <div class="layer-content">
          <div class="layer-name">
            <span class="layer-tool">API gateways</span>
            <span class="layer-tag layer-tag-warn">blind on Max &amp; Pro</span>
          </div>
          <p class="layer-desc">Intercept the API key. But Claude Code Max and Pro route through Anthropic's subscription — there's no API key to intercept.</p>
          <div class="layer-examples muted">
            <code>Bifrost</code>
            <code>Helicone</code>
            <code>Portkey</code>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <p class="layers-callout">
      RTK is the only token optimizer that works on <strong>Claude Code Max &amp; Pro</strong> — because there's no API key to intercept.
    </p>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
.layers-section {
  background: var(--bg-alt);
}

.layers-accent {
  color: var(--accent);
}

.layers-diagram {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--space-3);
  margin: var(--space-8) 0;
}

/* Base layer row */
.layer {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 48px 1fr auto;
  gap: var(--space-5);
  align-items: start;
  padding: var(--space-5) var(--space-6);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  background: var(--bg-card);
  transition: border-color 0.2s;
}

/* RTK highlighted row */
.layer-rtk {
  border-color: var(--accent);
  background: rgba(0, 229, 153, 0.04);
}

/* Blind spot row */
.layer-blind {
  border-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.3);
}

/* Badge */
.layer-badge {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: var(--text-xs);
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--text-dim);
  padding-top: 3px;
}

.layer-rtk .layer-badge {
  color: var(--accent);
}

/* Content */
.layer-content {
  min-width: 0;
}

.layer-name {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--space-3);
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
}

.layer-tool {
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--text-bright);
}

.layer-rtk .layer-tool {
  color: var(--accent);
}

.layer-tag {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.68rem;
  padding: 2px 8px;
  border-radius: 99px;
  background: rgba(0, 229, 153, 0.12);
  color: var(--accent);
  border: 1px solid rgba(0, 229, 153, 0.25);
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.layer-tag-warn {
  background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.1);
  color: #f87171;
  border-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.25);
}

.layer-desc {
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin: 0 0 var(--space-3);
}

.layer-other .layer-desc,
.layer-blind .layer-desc {
  color: var(--text-dim);
}

.layer-examples {
  display: flex;
  gap: var(--space-2);
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.layer-examples code {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.72rem;
  padding: 2px 8px;
  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  background: rgba(0, 229, 153, 0.08);
  color: var(--accent);
  border: 1px solid rgba(0, 229, 153, 0.15);
}

.layer-examples.muted code {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
  color: var(--text-dim);
  border-color: var(--border);
}

/* Stat badge on RTK row */
.layer-stat {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--accent);
  text-align: right;
  white-space: nowrap;
  padding-top: 2px;
}

.layer-stat span {
  display: block;
  font-size: 0.65rem;
  font-weight: 400;
  color: var(--text-dim);
  text-align: right;
  margin-top: 2px;
}

/* Callout */
.layers-callout {
  padding: var(--space-5) var(--space-6);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  background: rgba(0, 229, 153, 0.04);
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin: 0;
}

.layers-callout strong {
  color: var(--text-bright);
}

/* Responsive */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .layer {
    grid-template-columns: 32px 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-4);
  }

  .layer-stat {
    grid-column: 2;
    text-align: left;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
}

@media (max-width: 480px) {
  .layer-examples {
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }
}
</style>
